# AUR repos should contain only packaging files. Ignore everything by default
# (build artifacts: src/, pkg/, *.pkg.tar.*, the downloaded .deb) and allow
# back only the files that belong in the repo. If you ever add a .install file
# or a patch, whitelist it here with another `!` line.
*
!.gitignore
!PKGBUILD
!.SRCINFO
